# Local dev-session tooling artifacts (e.g. a pre-commit review-gate stamp) —
# never part of the shipped product.
.claude/

# Internal build rationale / audit trail never belongs in this public repo —
# keep it in a separate private repo (or just locally, uncommitted).
# This includes self-review / positioning critiques: a repo that ships a
# catalogue of its own weaknesses hands a skeptic the ammunition. Findings
# belong in the issue tracker; the review itself belongs in private notes.
docs/DESIGN.md
docs/PLAN.md
docs/positioning-review.md
docs/audits/
docs/workstreams/
NOTES*.md
*.internal.md
